{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415021","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415021","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041502101:1":{"text":"오늘은 날이 정말 좋아, 나쁜 짓 하기 딱 좋은 날씨지? 이렇게 전혀 어울리지 않는 벌건 대낮에 말이야!","source_cn":"真是个好日子，对吧？是个非常适合做坏事的天气吧？就在这...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4349D7674BA7B5F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041502102:1":{"text":"미학에 대해 논하기 딱 좋은 날씨네.","source_cn":"如果要对美学进行一番探讨，那确实是非常适宜的天气。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30D34D2C64621B38","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041502103:1":{"text":"그럼, 오늘을 기념해서 나쁜 짓을 저지르자!","source_cn":"那么，为了庆祝这样的日子，我们来做点更坏的事吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F31269231CC3AB6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041502104:1":{"text":"손님들의 다기 세트를 어질러 놓는 거야. 세트마다 포크나 잔 받침을 하나씩 빼서 아무 세트에나 섞어두는 거지!","source_cn":"把客人的茶具套装打乱，每一套都随机抽去叉子或茶托！再把...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02D86B6D69D48BE2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041502105:1":{"text":"하하하하! 간단한 장난으로 모두를 혼란스럽게 할 수 있다니, 정말 즐거워!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈！一个小小的恶作剧，就能让所有人都陷入混乱，真...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x41CA590B5C89145B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041502106:1":{"text":"세트로 있는 다기를 뒤죽박죽 섞어 놓겠다고?","source_cn":"拆开配套的茶具？完全乱序的摆放？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0A726C118BDF4BC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041502107:1":{"text":"이 얼마나 추잡스러운 행동인가! 상상만으로도 온몸에 전율이 흘러!","source_cn":"何等的丑陋，何等的失态！光是想想就让我浑身战栗不已！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1011749168C3F916","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041502108:1":{"text":"잠깐... 사람을 불쾌하게 만드는 건 악행이야. 하지만 악마를 광기와 고통에 빠뜨리는 건 선행을 하는 건데...","source_cn":"等等……让人不爽是作恶，但让恶魔陷入疯狂和痛苦又是行善……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x59E1297DCC6DB43F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041502109:1":{"text":"아아, 내가 이런 딜레마에 빠지게 되다니?! 이 무슨 운명의 장난인가!","source_cn":"啊啊，为什么我会被置于如此两难的境地？！这是命运的捉弄吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E94733CD846EA81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:贝利尔":{"text":"베릴","source":"贝利尔","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:雷内亚":{"text":"카투투카","source":"雷内亚","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":10,"localized_text_count":9,"speaker_count":2}}